    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sheba kūngomela Daūdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūsangwa alīho hoi ngosha ūmò ng'wangū kūpelana būpelanu būtī na solobo, lina lyakwe Sheba ng'witūnja o ng'wa Bikili, wa lūganda lwa Benjamini. Ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūng'ang'aaja mhembe; hūna ūhamuka n'ilaka lya higūlya alīhaya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abishai kūgatongeela mabità",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Daūdi ūng'wīla ū Amasa, “Nitanīlage pye a bashilikale ba mu lūganda lwa Yuda, mu shikū idatū babize bashikaga aha; nū bebe ūbize ūlīho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Amasa aho waja, ūmala ko ikanza ilīhu kūtinda īlo walī wahelelwa nū ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ū Daūdi ūng'wīla Abishai, “Alilūūlū ū Sheba ng'wana Bikili ng'wenūyū akūtwītīla yabūbi kūtinda ūmo walī watwītīlile Abusalomu. Basolage a batūmami ba ng'wa so būgonzo ūnkūūbīje, nguno nose akūpeelela kū mizengo īgītīlījiwe ndugu apūlūgūke.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a banhū ba ng'wa Yoabu, na a Bakeleeti na a Bapeleeti, hamò na a bagosha ba mbagashūūla pye a bose būbūūka bajile, balī ha sīlīlī ya būtongeeji bo ng'wa Abishai. Bīnga ī Yelusalemu balīnkūūbīja ū Sheba ng'witūnja o ng'wa Bikili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amasa kūbūlagwa na Yoabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būshika Gibeoni ipandī ilebe lyalīho iwe itaale, hūna ū Amasa wiza nang'hwe alībasūng'wanha. Ī likanza lyenīlo ū Yoabu walī azwalile shizwalo shakwe sha mu būlūgū, hūna ū mu nkīmbīlī witunga nshipi gwa nyashilikale, na lūshū mu shilaalo shalo; kwimanīla lwalagala hasī aho alīshimīza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yoabu ūndima ū Amasa kū ndezu na nkono gwakwe gwa būlyo gītī alīhaya kūmbipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Amasa wikala atalūdīlīlile ū lūshū ūlo lwalī ū mu nkono go ng'wa Yoabu; hūna ū Yoabu ūng'ohoola mu nda, widīka hasī ū būla. Ū Amasa ūchīla henaho, atachimilwe lūkangala lwa kabīlī. Hūna ū Yoabu nū ng'wanong'wawe ū Abishai būduta bajile bakūnkūūbījaga ū Sheba ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Bikili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmò wa banhū ba ng'wa Yoabu wīmīīla hihī nū Amasa ūyūbawīla a banhū, “Ūyo ang'hayile Yoabu, nū yūyo alī kū lwandī lwa ng'wa Daūdi anondeele Yoabu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Amasa walī alambalalile hasī ha gatī gatī y'ikūūwa akūgalagalaga mu mininga gakwe; ū munhū ūyo wabawīlaga a banhū ūbona bayīmīīla henaho. Aho wabona gīkī būlī ng'wene alīyūshika a halī Amasa wīmīīla, ūmveveenya ang'wīngije a h'ikūūwa, ūntwala ng'witongo ūūkantūūla ng'wenūmo ūmponegeja līng'wenda ūnkundīkīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Amasa aho wīnjiwa a h'ikūūwa, pye a banhū būja na lūgendo lwabo, balīnondeela ū Yoabu, kūnkūūbīja ū Sheba ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Bikili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūbūlagwa kwa ng'wa Sheba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Sheba ūjiyeeleela pyī ī ng'anda ja mu Isilaeli, ūūkashika Abeli ya Beti-maaka, nī Belilti ī yose; bibilinga kūnondeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mabità ga ng'wa Yoabu aho gashika ī Abeli ya Beti-maaka gūgūtinganīla ū nzengo gwenūyo. Būzenga ikīgo lya kūgūpīndya ū nzengo, lyūkandīkīja a ha ndugu īyo yalī īgūpīndīlīgije ū nzengo, hūna bandya kwīpūūlīīla ī ndugu īgwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkīma ūmò nchagūku ūhīlīka kūfuma ū mu gatī ya nzengo alīhaya, “Bing'we bababa, degelekagi! Nidegeleki! Ng'wīlagi ū Yoabu egeele aha nayombe nang'hwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wegeela hoi, ū nkīma ūbūūja, “Ū bebe h'ūlī ng'wene ū Yoabu?” Nang'hwe ūshosha, “Na nene ng'hana!” Ū nkīma ūhaya, “Baba degelekaga ūmo alīhayīla ū ntūmami wako.” Ūhaya, “Naadegelekaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ūhaya, “Ī kale biwīlaga gīkī, ‘Ūlū mutogilwe kūganikīlwa chiza, jagi Abeli; na ng'hana yagololokaga ī mihayo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bise tūlī banhū ba mhola na ba kūsanyiwa ū mu Isilaeli. Baba ūlīhaya kūkenaagūla nzengo ūyo gūlī ninaabo ū mu Isilaeli. Ni kinehe ūlīhaya kūbūgabbula ū wingīji bo ng'wa SEEBA?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoabu ūshosha ūhaya, “Ī liganiko lyenīlo lītī lyane ū nene, nīyo ī liganiko lya kūgabbula nūūlū kūkenaagūla ni līkachīlage kūle! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ītī gīko na hado yaya; alīho munhū ūmò, lina lyakwe Sheba ng'witūnja o ng'wa Bikili, wa kū sī ja magūlya ga Efalimu. Ū munhū ng'wenūyo wagoloolile nkono gwakwe kūng'ūbūkīla ū ntemi Daūdi. Ūlū ng'ūmfunya ū munhū ng'wenūyo, ū nene nīnga na kwīnga a ha nzengo gwing'we.” Ū nkīma ūng'wīla ū Yoabu, “Lenda lendagi hado lūūlū mukūponegejiwa ū ntwe gwakwe kūfuma kwigūlya ya ndugu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ng'wenūyo aho wīnga a henaho, ūūkatūmamīla masala gakwe, ūlūngalūnga nabo pye a banhū, būntīna ū ntwe gwakwe ū Sheba ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Bikili; būgūponeja hanze ū kūlī Yoabu. Yoabu nang'hwe ūlīja na kūlīja mhembe yakwe, bīnga a banhū bakwe a ha ndugu ya nzengo, būshoka kaya būlī ng'wene kū ng'wakwe. Ū Yoabu nang'hwe ūshoka Yelusalemu kūlī ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoabu ng'wenūyo hū walī ntaale walyo pyī ī libità lya Baisilaeli. Ū ntaale wa Bakeleeti na a Bapeleeti walī Benaya ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yehoyada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntaale wa milīmo y'ihadīke walī Adonilamu. Ū ng'wandīki wa mihayo ya būsugi walī Yehoshafati ng'witūnja o ng'wa Ahiludi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kalani ntaale walī Sheva; a bagabīji baalī ba Sadoki na Abiasaali; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū ngabījibo ng'wa Daūdi walī Ila muna Yaili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
